Chapter: GroundsScope
  grounds Device.Mmio

 Grounding is SCOPED to the named effects. This chapter grounds
 Device.Mmio but performs port-out-byte (a [Device.Port] intrinsic), so
 Device.Port is neither declared nor grounded, and touch is rejected
 with CDX2031. A chapter cannot launder some other hardware effect
 through the exemption it took for a different one. Note
 the exemption flag is on -- the effectful let is not a CDX2033 here --
 yet the scoped row check still catches the wrong effect.

Section: Body
  touch : Integer -> Integer
  touch (p) =
   let w = port-out-byte p 0
   in w

  opening : [Console] Nothing
  opening = act
   let r = touch 128
   in print-line-uni "x"
  end
